{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Progress 2026-10-31: fix pushed as Gerrit change 3177 patch set 1 (df9e5082105). Root cause reproduced independently: against a local HTTP server whose detail GET keeps reporting the submitted SHA as current, a 409 with the 3169 conflict body printed 'no longer current'; after the fix it prints the merge-conflict message with the rebase remedy, then Gerrit's body. 6 tests failed before the fix; tests/unit/test_gerrit_submit_if_current_8b1c.py passes 23/23 after; make lint and make typecheck exit 0. Deviation from the plan's Testing section: test_safe_submit_409_with_empty_body_keeps_todays_line (added by suppletive-curative-bug) asserted the old staleness line for a 409 whose re-read shows no new revision, so it was renamed to ..._does_not_claim_staleness and now asserts the generic 409 wording. LLM-Review +1. Verified -1 from an unrelated failure in tests/unit/test_llm_timeouts.py::test_tool_timeout_cancels_an_async_tool on the py3.11 cell (elapsed 4.78s > 4.5s bound, cancel confirmed); filed as cuddly-callous-antlion. Not rechecked: AGENTS.md reserves recheck for provably environmental faults. Ticket stays in_progress pending a decision on how to get a green Verified."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793477673808762001,"uuid":"5c13c40e-095f-49b6-b2f6-d74c0b51ee8f"}